  "description": "Hover-1’s My First E-Bike is the perfect E-Bike for beginners. This E-Bike is easy to ride and low to the ground with its 14” wheels. Powered by a 150W motor outputting a top speed of 8 mph, the My First E-Bike is fun and safe for children up to 132 lbs. Cruise the neighborhood or nearby parks for up to 7.5 miles on a single charge! The battery recharges in only 4 hours or less. With a height adjustable seat, your child can continue to enjoy their My First E-Bike even after they’ve grown for several years. Give your child the gift of adventure with the Hover-1 My First E-Bike!",
